WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
How do you get an exact area without strips?

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.060
Find a function whose slope is the curve.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:12.680
For x², that is x³/3.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:17.690
Take its value at the end, minus its value at the start.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:22.320
From 0 to 3: 9 − 0.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.500
The area is exactly 9.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.010
No strips needed.
